# HDS deployment requires schema-only Parquet assets; CI rejects populated files.
!vendor/microsoft-hds/*/HDS.SourceCode/src/table_schemas/**/*.parquet
!vendor/microsoft-hds/*/HDS.SourceCode/hds-build-artifacts/healthcare-tables/**/*.parquet
